### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products/1

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:5176/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic optical mouse",
  "price": 45.99,
  "stock": 15
}